  "title": "India's Independence Day Speechs: Shortest Ever",
  "summary": "India's 79th Independence Day speech was the shortest in four years and its fourth shortest ever, with PM Modi delivering only 75 minutes. This was the shortest speech since the 103-minute address delivered last year.",
  "facts": [
